  "extraction_notes": "This figure is a catalyst overview rather than experimental reaction equations with specific substrates/products. Per instructions, the generic amidation header was captured as a separate wildcard reaction, and each labeled catalyst (1–6) was emitted as its own reaction variant. Catalyst 3 includes an unspecified counterion shown as X−; RDKit cannot validate an unspecified anion placeholder, so only the cationic boronic acid framework was validated and recorded, with the missing counterion noted in role_note. The generic catalyst ArB(OH)2 in the header was represented by phenylboronic acid as a wildcard-free generic arylboronic acid surrogate because the submission schema does not support atom-labeled Ar group placeholders directly in named catalyst text while still requiring validated SMILES."
